WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.002
This is Cloudflare Starter: a small app your agents can use.

2
00:00:08.002 --> 00:00:19.771
The demo is the starter itself.

3
00:00:19.771 --> 00:00:28.003
Sign-in, workspaces and billing are already done.

4
00:00:28.003 --> 00:00:38.002
An agent asks for access. You allow it.

5
00:00:38.002 --> 00:00:48.002
It works in your app, as you.

6
00:00:48.002 --> 00:00:58.000
Invite your team.

7
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:08.002
Plans and limits are built in.

8
00:01:08.002 --> 00:01:18.001
Admin, health and logs: solved.

9
00:01:18.001 --> 00:01:25.002
It all runs on the $5 Cloudflare plan.

10
00:01:25.002 --> 00:01:29.960
Clone it and ship.
